---
// 2026-11-08 (Jason, launch): the curtain IS the gift. The home page opens the gift
// (the heart, the languages, the beeps) at /gift/. DAX line kept for the deploy gate;
// data-countdown skips the full-home content gates; privacy link present but hidden.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-countdown>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="od-no-beacon" content="1">
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/gift/">
<title>DAX Foundation</title>
<style>
  html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#000;color:#f2f2f2;
    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif}
  body{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:0 16px}
  #d{font-size:clamp(1rem,3vw,1.6rem);max-width:34em;line-height:1.4;font-weight:400;opacity:.85}
  #privz{position:fixed;left:-9999px;opacity:0}
</style>
<script is:inline>window.location.replace('/gift/');</script>
</head>
<body>
<p id="d">DAX: preservation and expansion of life, humanity, and consciousness.</p>
<a id="privz" href="/privacy/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">Privacy</a>
